  "domain": "tier0/api-probes/mask-stack",
  "description": "API probe: mask-stack context rules. A fill effect in a layer mask takes no channel type (None) for its source, blending and opacity; the probes record what a channel argument raises there, what None raises on the content layer, the mask properties, a second add_mask, and a levels effect in the mask, with the BaseColor export.",
